class=\"bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded\">Completed</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface font-semibold\">Shipping &amp; Payment</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden md:block w-16 h-px bg-outline-variant/60\"></div>\n<!-- Step 3: Review & Place Order (Active / Current) -->\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 w-full md:w-auto\">\n<div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed border-2 border-primary text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-label-md text-label-md font-bold\">\n            3\n          </div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\">Step 3</span>\n<span class=\"bg-primary text-on-primary text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded\">Current</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary font-bold\">Review &amp; Place Order</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- PAGE HEADER TITLE & NOTIFICATION -->\n<div class=\"mb-10\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4 pb-4\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight\">Review Your Order</h1>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2 max-w-2xl\">\n            Please review your items, delivery address, and payment information before finalizing your artisan order. Each vessel is inspected and prepared in our Portland studio.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-left md:text-right\">\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary\">Order Reference Intent:</span>\n<span class=\"font-mono text-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface block\">ECC-2024-8842-REV</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Breakage-Free Guarantee Notice Banner -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/50 rounded-lg p-4 flex items-center gap-3.5 text-on-surface\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">verified_user</span>\n<div class=\"flex-grow\">\n<span class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface\">Breakage-Free Guarantee:</span>\n<span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant ml-1\">\n            Every piece is custom-packaged in eco-cushioned insulated crates. If an artisan creation arrives damaged, we replace it at zero expense or commission an exact remake immediately.\n          </span>\n</div>\n<a class=\"text-primary hover:underline text-body-sm font-label-md whitespace-nowrap hidden sm:inline\" href=\"#\">Learn More</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- TWO-COLUMN LAYOUT -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start\">\n<!-- ==================== LEFT COLUMN (Main Review Area, 65% width / 8 cols) ==================== -->\n<div class=\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-6\">\n<!-- 1. ITEMIZED ITEMS IN ORDER CARD -->\n<section class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl border ledger-border overflow-hidden shadow-sm\">\n<div class=\"px-6 py-4.5 bg-surface-container-low/60 border-b ledger-border flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant\">inventory_2</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface\">Items for Shipment (3 items)</h2>\n</div>\n<button class=\"text-primary hover:underline font-label-md text-label-md flex items-center gap-1\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">edit</span>\n              Edit Bag\n            </button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"divide-y ledger-border\">\n<!-- Item 1 -->\n<article class=\"p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start sm:items-center justify-between hover:bg-surface-bright/50 transition-colors\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-20 h-24 sm:w-24 sm:h-28 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-surfac